  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### How to set up and configure Invoice Templates\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 6 Apr, 2023 at  8:15 AM\n\n\t\tTo access the Invoice Templates you can click this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.\n\nClick here for video\n\nNavigation: Practice Management > Settings > Invoice Templates\n\nOnce you have followed the navigation above there are two options\n\nOn 'Templates (Doc') you can upload your own invoice templates. However, you will need to use Capium tags provided in the attachment of this article so that the system can pick up various information such as the Client Name, Invoice Amount etc.\n\nOn 'Templates (PDF)' you can choose from the 5 different Invoice Templates within the software and customise them to your liking.\n\nFurthermore, you are able to add your logo and footer on the Invoice Template through Bookkeeping. To add your company logo and footer you can click this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping > Settings > General Settings > Company Logo\n\nOnce you have followed the navigation, you are able to upload your company logo. The maximum size of the logo is 120 x 600 px.\n\nIf you would like to edit the footer on the Invoice Template click this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping > Settings > General Settings > Invoice Templates\n\nOnce you have followed the navigation, select edit on your current Invoice Template.\n\nBy scrolling all the way down, you are able to view the footer of the Invoice Template which you are able to personalise. Once it has been updated in Bookkeeping, it will also be automatically updated in Practice Management module. \n\n\t\t docx  Invoice-defa... (27.9 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to set up and configure Invoice Templates\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 6 Apr, 2023 at  8:15 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">To access the Invoice Templates you can <a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/settings/invoice-templates\"><strong>click this link</strong></a>. <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: NaN%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/bee56171dc8544b2bb5f3f339fb6763a\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/bee56171dc8544b2bb5f3f339fb6763a\"><strong>Click here for video</strong></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation</strong>: Practice Management &gt; Settings &gt; Invoice Templates</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9175646676/original/JrsDdKqoLNvSEjCPcLQXDKguzUXiqL9MMw.png?1671193907\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9175646676\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once you have followed the navigation above there are two options</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">On 'Templates (Doc') you can upload your own invoice templates. However, you will need to use Capium tags provided in the attachment of this article so that the system can pick up various information such as the Client Name, Invoice Amount etc.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"521\"><br data-identifyelement=\"522\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">On 'Templates (PDF)' you can choose from the 5 different Invoice Templates within the software and customise them to your liking.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">Furthermore, you are able to add your logo and footer on the Invoice Template through Bookkeeping. To add your company logo and footer you can <strong><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/bookkeeping/settings/Logo.aspx\">click this link.</a></strong> <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation</strong>: Bookkeeping &gt; Settings &gt; General Settings &gt; Company Logo</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9175655984/original/xH_VAqU644zH9LG1f8ZqaTqyXFDn1IfmhQ.png?1671200062\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9175655984\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">Once you have followed the navigation, you are able to upload your company logo. The maximum size of the logo is <strong>120 x 600 px</strong>.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">If you would like to edit the footer on the Invoice Template <a href=\"https://app.capium.com/bookkeeping/settings/invoicetemplates.aspx\"><strong>click this link</strong></a>. <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Navigation</strong>: Bookkeeping &gt; Settings &gt; General Settings &gt; Invoice Templates</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9175656718/original/7mMuGQrgYPmgzBPQTf3LOGJvICQ-f_Ai0A.png?1671200493\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9175656718\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">Once you have followed the navigation, select edit on your current Invoice Template.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9175657032/original/319zXY_9iAJx4GBr33JQqdH7KzCbJyQY1w.png?1671200669\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9175657032\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\">By scrolling all the way down, you are able to view the footer of the Invoice Template which you are able to personalise. Once it has been updated in Bookkeeping, it will also be automatically updated in Practice Management module.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-9000222508-attachments\"><div class=\"attachment\"><div class=\"attachment-type\"><span class=\"file-type\"> docx </span> </div><div class=\"attach_content\"><div class=\"ellipsis\"><a href=\"/helpdesk/attachments/9175663531\" class=\"filename\" target=\"_blank\" data-toggle='tooltip' title='Invoice-default tags.docx'\n                >Invoice-defa... </a></div><div>(27.9 KB) </div></div></div></div>\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000222508\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000222508/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000222508\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000222508/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000222508\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
